1: err=true log=[~y ~x]
2.1: fail building a log=[]
2.2: fail building b log=[~a]
2.3: ok log=[built ~a ~b]
3: bottom log=[~d0 ~d1 ~d2]
4: err=true log=[~v0 ~v1 ~v2]
5: expect failed counter=1 log=[~inner inner caught ~outer]
6: Some(42) log=[~fine]
7: called `Result::unwrap()` on an `Err` value: "bad value" log=[~opt]
